{
  "name": "E2E KV Store - Kick And Re-Add Deny-List Cycle (Restricted Subgroup)",
  "description": "Wire-level coverage for the deny-list add → remove → re-add cycle whose store-level invariants are pinned by the unit tests `deny_list_add_remove_add_cycle_ends_cleared` (group_store/tests.rs:5887) and `deny_list_remove_then_readd_clears_entry_via_apply_path` (5988). No existing E2E exercises this on a real cluster — `group-membership.yml` adds → removes → asserts revoked, then stops.\nScenario (3 nodes, single Restricted subgroup):\n\n  1. Admin (node-1) adds node-2 to a Restricted subgroup via\n     `add_group_members`. node-3 is also added so it can act as\n     the cross-peer reader and prove convergence.\n  2. node-2 writes; node-3 reads — establishes the post-add path.\n  3. Admin removes node-2 via `remove_group_members`. The signed\n     `MemberRemoved` op stamps the deny-list at every peer\n     (`group_store/mod.rs:1248` — `mark_denied`).\n  4. node-2's next write must NOT reach node-3 (deny-list filter).\n  5. Admin re-adds node-2 via `add_group_members`. The\n     `MemberAdded` apply arm clears node-2's deny-list entry on\n     every peer (the only end-to-end path that exercises the\n     `clear_denied` call inside the apply pipeline).\n  6. node-2 writes again; node-3 reads. Convergence proves the\n     deny-list was actually cleared on node-3 — without that, the\n     new write would still be dropped at node-3's filter.\n\nWhy Restricted (not Open): the inheritance path doesn't apply for Restricted subgroups, so the only way back in is admin-initiated `add_group_members`. The Open / inheritance path is covered by `group-kick-and-rejoin-keyshare.yml`.\nMero-chat user-visible failure mode this guards against: \"I was removed from a private channel, the admin added me back, but my messages still don't show up for the other members\" — the symptom of a stale deny-list entry on the receiver side.\n",
  "comment": [
    "Migrated from this file's v1 workflow by `merobox cloud port`.",
    "Each of the original scenario's nodes is an account here; see merobox/cloud_v2/port.py for the mapping.",
    "Dropped (no counterpart in this node):",
    "  login (unknown) x3: checks what the dropped steps did",
    "  wait_for_sync x5: replication is synchronous: a read sees every committed write"
  ],
  "cluster": {
    "nodes": 3
  },
  "accounts": [
    "kick-readd-node-1",
    "kick-readd-node-2",
    "kick-readd-node-3"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "name": "Install application on node-1",
      "type": "upload_bundle",
      "wasm": "{{env.CORE_WASM_DIR}}/scaffolding_e2e.wasm",
      "outputs": {
        "app_id_bundle": "hash"
      },
      "account": "kick-readd-node-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "set",
      "values": {
        "app_id": "com.calimero.scaffolding-e2e"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Node-1 creates namespace",
      "type": "create_org",
      "org_name": "Node-1 creates namespace",
      "outputs": {
        "namespace_id": "orgId"
      },
      "account": "kick-readd-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Invite node-2 to namespace",
      "type": "invite",
      "org": "{{namespace_id}}",
      "role": "member",
      "account": "kick-readd-node-1",
      "outputs": {
        "invite_node2": "token"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Invite node-3 to namespace",
      "type": "invite",
      "org": "{{namespace_id}}",
      "role": "member",
      "account": "kick-readd-node-1",
      "outputs": {
        "invite_node3": "token"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Node-2 joins namespace",
      "type": "redeem_invite",
      "token": "{{invite_node2}}",
      "account": "kick-readd-node-2"
    },
    {
      "type": "whoami",
      "account": "kick-readd-node-2",
      "outputs": {
        "identity_node2": "publicKey",
        "account_node2": "publicKey"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Node-3 joins namespace",
      "type": "redeem_invite",
      "token": "{{invite_node3}}",
      "account": "kick-readd-node-3"
    },
    {
      "type": "whoami",
      "account": "kick-readd-node-3",
      "outputs": {
        "identity_node3": "publicKey",
        "account_node3": "publicKey"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Node-1 creates Restricted subgroup",
      "type": "create_team",
      "org": "{{namespace_id}}",
      "team_name": "private-channel",
      "join": "invite",
      "outputs": {
        "subgroup_id": "teamId"
      },
      "account": "kick-readd-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Admin adds node-2 and node-3 to subgroup",
      "type": "team_add",
      "org": "{{namespace_id}}",
      "team": "{{subgroup_id}}",
      "members": [
        "{{identity_node2}}"
      ],
      "role": "member",
      "account": "kick-readd-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Admin adds node-2 and node-3 to subgroup",
      "type": "team_add",
      "org": "{{namespace_id}}",
      "team": "{{subgroup_id}}",
      "members": [
        "{{identity_node3}}"
      ],
      "role": "member",
      "account": "kick-readd-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Node-1 creates context inside Restricted subgroup",
      "type": "deploy",
      "account": "kick-readd-node-1",
      "wasm": "{{env.CORE_WASM_DIR}}/scaffolding_e2e.wasm",
      "app_name": "Node-1 creates context inside Restricted subgroup",
      "org": "{{namespace_id}}",
      "access": {
        "kind": "team",
        "team": "{{subgroup_id}}"
      },
      "outputs": {
        "ctx_id": "contextId"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Wait for MemberAdded + ContextRegistered to propagate",
      "type": "wait",
      "seconds": 10.0
    },
    {
      "name": "Node-2 joins context",
      "type": "whoami",
      "account": "kick-readd-node-2",
      "outputs": {
        "node2_key": "publicKey"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Node-3 joins context",
      "type": "whoami",
      "account": "kick-readd-node-3",
      "outputs": {
        "node3_key": "publicKey"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Pre-kick — node-2 writes",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set",
      "args": {
        "key": "pre_kick",
        "value": "node2_first_msg"
      },
      "account": "kick-readd-node-2",
      "as_key": "{{node2_key}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Pre-kick — node-3 reads node-2's write",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{ctx_id}}",
      "method": "get",
      "args": {
        "key": "pre_kick"
      },
      "account": "kick-readd-node-3",
      "as_key": "{{node3_key}}",
      "outputs": {
        "pre_kick_read": "rpc"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Assert pre-kick converged",
      "type": "json_assert",
      "statements": [
        "json_equal({{pre_kick_read}}, {\"output\": \"node2_first_msg\"})"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Admin removes node-2 from subgroup",
      "type": "team_remove",
      "org": "{{namespace_id}}",
      "team": "{{subgroup_id}}",
      "members": [
        "{{account_node2}}"
      ],
      "account": "kick-readd-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Confirm node-2 absent from subgroup membership",
      "type": "team_get",
      "org": "{{namespace_id}}",
      "team": "{{subgroup_id}}",
      "account": "kick-readd-node-1",
      "outputs": {
        "members_after_kick": "members"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Assert node-2 absent after kick",
      "type": "assert",
      "statements": [
        "not_contains({{members_after_kick}}, {{account_node2}})",
        "contains({{members_after_kick}}, {{account_node3}})"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Post-kick — node-2 attempts write (must fail or be dropped)",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set",
      "args": {
        "key": "while_kicked",
        "value": "this_must_not_appear"
      },
      "account": "kick-readd-node-2",
      "as_key": "{{node2_key}}",
      "expected_failure": true
    },
    {
      "name": "Drain in-flight gossip before negative-control read",
      "type": "wait",
      "seconds": 5.0
    },
    {
      "name": "Negative control — node-3 must NOT see the dropped write",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{ctx_id}}",
      "method": "get",
      "args": {
        "key": "while_kicked"
      },
      "account": "kick-readd-node-3",
      "as_key": "{{node3_key}}",
      "outputs": {
        "while_kicked_pre_readd": "rpc"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Assert dropped value is genuinely absent on node-3 BEFORE re-add",
      "type": "json_assert",
      "statements": [
        "json_equal({{while_kicked_pre_readd}}, {\"output\": null})"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Admin re-adds node-2 to subgroup",
      "type": "team_add",
      "org": "{{namespace_id}}",
      "team": "{{subgroup_id}}",
      "members": [
        "{{identity_node2}}"
      ],
      "role": "member",
      "account": "kick-readd-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Confirm node-2 is back in subgroup membership",
      "type": "team_get",
      "org": "{{namespace_id}}",
      "team": "{{subgroup_id}}",
      "account": "kick-readd-node-1",
      "outputs": {
        "members_after_readd": "members"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Assert node-2 present after re-add",
      "type": "assert",
      "statements": [
        "contains({{members_after_readd}}, {{account_node2}})",
        "contains({{members_after_readd}}, {{account_node3}})"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Post-readd — node-2 writes",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set",
      "args": {
        "key": "post_readd",
        "value": "node2_back_msg"
      },
      "account": "kick-readd-node-2",
      "as_key": "{{node2_key}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Post-readd — node-3 reads node-2's write",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{ctx_id}}",
      "method": "get",
      "args": {
        "key": "post_readd"
      },
      "account": "kick-readd-node-3",
      "as_key": "{{node3_key}}",
      "outputs": {
        "post_readd_read": "rpc"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Assert post-readd write reached node-3",
      "type": "json_assert",
      "statements": [
        "json_equal({{post_readd_read}}, {\"output\": \"node2_back_msg\"})"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Confirm dropped-during-kick write was NOT delivered post-readd",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{ctx_id}}",
      "method": "get",
      "args": {
        "key": "while_kicked"
      },
      "account": "kick-readd-node-3",
      "as_key": "{{node3_key}}",
      "outputs": {
        "dropped_lookup": "rpc"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Assert dropped value was indeed dropped",
      "type": "json_assert",
      "statements": [
        "json_equal({{dropped_lookup}}, {\"output\": null})"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
